{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54732","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两月鬬，侯景犯梁朝。\n倘或遭逢如此兆，外藩（京本作「番」）雄略（京本作「客」）有谋韬，俱废若（京本作「永」）冰消。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}